[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1362229716","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1746#issuecomment-1362229716","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1746","id":1362229716,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85RMfnU","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-12-21T23:55:02Z","updated_at":"2022-12-21T23:55:02Z","body":"related to #1722  (note @jamesjer and @richardfontana )","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1362229716/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1368152247","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1746#issuecomment-1368152247","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1746","id":1368152247,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85RjFi3","user":{"login":"richardfontana","id":1179636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1179636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana","html_url":"https://github.com/richardfontana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-12-31T02:42:54Z","updated_at":"2022-12-31T02:43:26Z","body":"Since this is an exception to the INRIA variant (or one of the INRIA variants) of the \"real\" QPL, perhaps the exception shouldn't be named \"QPL-exception\" but perhaps something along the lines of \"QPL-INRIA-exception\" or whatever identifier is chosen in #1722 (or something else entirely - I don't think any of the GPL/LGPL exceptions have *GPL in their name).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1368152247/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1368502050","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1746#issuecomment-1368502050","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1746","id":1368502050,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85Rka8i","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-01-01T18:12:17Z","updated_at":"2023-01-01T18:12:17Z","body":"So I'm going back and forth a little bit on whether:\r\n\r\n1. the new QPL-1.0-INRIA-2004 in #1722 should _include_ this exception text -- such that we wouldn't need a separate entry on the exception list for this exception; or\r\n2. QPL-1.0-INRIA-2004 should be _just_ the modified QPL text, and this exception should be a separate entry (so that the HEVEA software would be \"QPL-1.0-INRIA-2004 WITH QPL-1.0-INRIA-exception\" or whatever).\r\n\r\nI'm _leaning_ towards option 2, for a couple of reasons:\r\n* INRIA has apparently framed their version of the \"Q Public License\" text as being a separate license, and this exception as being an exception to it; and\r\n* in practice, INRIA has put a different LGPL exception in the middle of the QPL exception and QPL text -- so having it as just a single license entry would probably be harder for license scanning tools to match correctly.\r\n\r\nSo I'm +1 to adding this as a separate exception, even though in practice QPL-1.0-INRIA-2004 might always only occur together with this exception. And I suppose a downstream licensee _could_ perhaps strip away the exception if they chose to do so.\r\n\r\nAs far as name and ID, I agree with @richardfontana above that I would incorporate INRIA into the name as with #1722. I'd suggest the following based on where we're aligning in that issue and on some of the other names on the [exceptions list](https://spdx.org/licenses/exceptions-index.html):\r\n\r\n* ID: QPL-1.0-INRIA-2004-exception\r\n* name: INRIA QPL 1.0 2004 variant exception\r\n\r\nbut I'm not tied to these and could be persuaded otherwise.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1368502050/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1424582884","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1746#issuecomment-1424582884","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1746","id":1424582884,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85U6Wjk","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-02-09T17:48:52Z","updated_at":"2023-02-09T17:48:52Z","body":"+1 to add","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1424582884/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1424586553","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1746#issuecomment-1424586553","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1746","id":1424586553,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85U6Xc5","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-02-09T17:51:23Z","updated_at":"2023-02-09T17:51:23Z","body":"Discussed on 2023-02-09 legal team call, agreed to add with this ID and name.","author_association