ml-LGPL-linking-exception )\r\n\r\nShould we just add the one paragraph and markup for Software/Generator?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1426608451/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1426639529","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1746#issuecomment-1426639529","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1746","id":1426639529,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85VCMqp","user":{"login":"richardfontana","id":1179636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1179636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana","html_url":"https://github.com/richardfontana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-02-11T06:56:36Z","updated_at":"2023-02-11T06:56:36Z","body":"@jlovejoy FWIW, the one that @jamesjer submitted for Fedora is the frama-c one. Though hevea is also in Fedora.\r\n\r\nI would treat the two one-paragraph OCaml exceptions as equivalent and make Software/